msgid "story.algeria.ch1.title"
msgstr "[Draft] Preparations"

msgid "story.algeria.ch1.scene1"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] The community meets after sunset. The first task is clear: the command post must grow so that plans can be made and kept in order."

msgid "story.algeria.ch1.scene2"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] Work begins at dawn. Everyone has a part to play, however small."

msgid "story.algeria.ch2.title"
msgstr "[Draft] A Trusted Helper"

msgid "story.algeria.ch2.scene1"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] Word spreads that a trusted person is ready to help. Someone with the right skills could guide the community's efforts."

msgid "story.algeria.ch2.scene2"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] A first small group is ready to be organized. They will need training, and someone to lead them."

msgid "story.algeria.ch3.title"
msgstr "[Draft] The First Outing"

msgid "story.algeria.ch3.scene1"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] The first outing is planned with care. The leader and the group set out to test what they have prepared."

msgid "story.algeria.ch3.scene2"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] Back home, the group reflects on what went well, and on what to improve."

msgid "story.vietnam.ch1.title"
msgstr "[Draft] Preparations"

msgid "story.vietnam.ch1.scene1"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] The community gathers under the trees after dark. The first task is clear: the command post must grow so that plans can be made and kept in order."

msgid "story.vietnam.ch1.scene2"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] Work begins at first light. Everyone has a part to play, however small."

msgid "story.vietnam.ch2.title"
msgstr "[Draft] A Trusted Helper"

msgid "story.vietnam.ch2.scene1"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] Word spreads that a trusted person who knows the paths is ready to help. Someone with the right skills could guide the community's efforts."

msgid "story.vietnam.ch2.scene2"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] A first small group is ready to be organized. They will need training, and someone to lead them."

msgid "story.vietnam.ch3.title"
msgstr "[Draft] The First Outing"

msgid "story.vietnam.ch3.scene1"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] The first outing is planned with care. The leader and the group set out to test what they have prepared."

msgid "story.vietnam.ch3.scene2"
msgstr "[Draft, needs historian review] Back at camp, the group reflects on what went well, and on what to improve."

